# ==========================================================================
# Learn Machine Learn — environment variables
# ==========================================================================
# Copy this file to `.env.local` for local development:
#     cp .env.example .env.local
#
# `.env.local` is gitignored (see *.local in .gitignore) so your secrets
# stay out of version control. NEVER commit real tokens.
# ==========================================================================

# ------ Hugging Face Inference Provider token ------
# Note: We enforce a Bring-Your-Own-Key (BYOK) approach for security.
# Do NOT store API keys in environment variables for client-side use.
# Users must enter their Hugging Face token directly in the UI settings
# which will store it securely in their browser's localStorage.
